{"id":"n26750-1-8","stage":2,"title":"위아래 · 上下","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26750-1-8-1","ko":"나 오늘 장례식에 갔다 왔어.","zh":"我今天去参加葬礼了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"장례식에","meaning":"葬礼","explanation":"장례식：葬礼；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"장례식","audio":"/audio/95d4d16c44d9745f4653.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24804","senseId":"1","lemma":"장례식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장례식에","audio":"/audio/fdc1b741c838893b3deb.mp3"}},{"text":"갔다","meaning":"去参加（葬礼）","explanation":"가다：去、前往（参加活动）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"3","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갔다","audio":"/audio/fd82f61af73f8e8a4df4.mp3"}},{"text":"왔어.","meaning":"来，来参加","explanation":"오다：来，来参加；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"12","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔어","audio":"/audio/1c7a0c0d37b0eadd46f3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"